{
  "name": "diagnostics: needs nothing (confirmLoaded asks about a build that does not exist and may fail); a wake, which leaves the screen on, a screenshot, the UI tree, one tap in the status bar clear of an iPad window's controls, and a loaded check that finds nothing, and the attach of a load check that does not exist refused",
